%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoToSeptimus
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791044
    - rid: 4351268190826791045
    - rid: 4351268190826791046
    - rid: 4351268190826791047
    - rid: 4351268190826791048
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Sup, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791049
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791112
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791113
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791115
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Where are we heading, again?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791117
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: To talk to some insane guy who lives in an iceberg in a freezing ocean.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791118
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And where is this iceberg?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Over there.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791119
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I point in the direction of Septimus' hideout.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't see it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944440
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's because we're not close enough, Monika.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Things do become more noticeable the closer you are to them, of course.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944441
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And, to be fair, his hideout is an iceberg in a sea of ice...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944442
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944443
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So we're going to be taking a boat?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944444
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: In the game I would usually just run on the little chunks of ice, like
      a moron.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944446
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But considering that we would actually be the ones going in that freezing
      water...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944447
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We probably should...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944445
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... probably?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944448
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944449
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944450
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Where's the boat, {mc}...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... crap.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you expect us to swim through literal ice water?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944451
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Obviously not!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: If I remember right, there should be a boat on Septimus' end of the Ghost
      Sea...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Which isn't very helpful for us.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Crap...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944452
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Help, please...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944453
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I don't know!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944455
    - rid: 4351268260154179677
    - rid: 4351268260154179678
    - rid: 4351268260154179681
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, there's a boat right over there.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944456
    - rid: 4351268260154179679
    - rid: 4351268260154179680
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look toward where Monika's pointing and, sure enough, there's a little
      fishing boat right there.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I could've sworn that there wasn't a boat there when we walked here...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Guess it's rowing time...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Thanks!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944459
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I didn't do anything, though...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... oh.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944460
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Monika, quit practicing your expressions and help me move this fella
      down to the water!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944462
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Sure thing, {mc}...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944463
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944464
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We've managed to make it to Septimus' hideout unscathed and dry.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944465
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ... this is it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944466
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep! Trust me, it feels bigger on the inside.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944467
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944468
    - rid: 4351268260154179586
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What's that big brass thing?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268234876944469
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that's the a Dwemer lockbox that contains the Oghma Infinium.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: The <i>what</i>?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The Oghma Infinium, it's a demonic book containing the forbidden secrets
      of the universe, nothing too crazy.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179584
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, what kind of secrets?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179585
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The kind that can overwhelm the mind of, and kill, a lesser intellect. '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179587
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But that's fine, we're not here for it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179588
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, Septimus. I heard you want to open this bad boy, and you'll need
      the knowledge of an Elder Scroll to do it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179589
    - rid: 4351268260154179590
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I want to! The thumping heart of Lorkh and the world lies behind
      it!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (The book you were talking about is a <i>heart</i>?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179643
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (No, Septimus is just mistaken. The heart he's talking about is either
      gone forever, or somewhere else.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179644
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah... anyway, you need someone to inscribe the knowledge of the Elder
      Scroll in Alftand onto your Dwemer cube, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The two of us are willing to go do that for you, since we're grabbing
      that Elder Scroll for ourselves.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179645
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: You would aid me in unveiling the desirer and desire of the world?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: You must take these two things, one spherical and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You don't need to tell me. I know what to do with these to get into Blackreach
      and get to the Tower of Mzark.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... you know?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: The two of you do have a strange weight...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179648
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... what???)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179646
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: What?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: I have felt many weights; the firmament bends around its expressions-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179647
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: Most are light, for they come from within; how could a branch weigh more
      than the tree?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: The Earthbones have weight; they are what hold the layers in place-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: The expressions of Oblivion have weight; they never dispersed into form-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: The Elder Scrolls have weight; for they <i>are</i> creation, seeing before
      and after and above...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: So what are you to have a weight of your own...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ({mc}, this man is very clearly insane. What is he talking about?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179650
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, it's true that he's pretty insane...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179651
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (But to be fair, that's because he's seen a lot more than most people
      have; his ramblings about the firmament are pretty lore-accurate.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (So then what does he mean by us having "weight?")
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179652
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (So, he said that most don't have weight... I assume he's talking about
      people?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179653
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Or maybe anything that exists in general...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Since these things happen after the Aedra did their thing, I guess that
      means they behave within the bounds of comprehensible physics...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (And having "weight" in this meta-physical sense would mean being able
      to either override, influence, or ignore the rules of this reality.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (The Earthbones, or Aedra, basically became the laws of physics, so they
      have weight.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (The Daedra, having never gave up their power for creation, still have
      their weight and influence, basically having complete control over their realms.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (And the Elder Scrolls... well, they document <i>everything</i>. Everything
      that's happened, everything that could happen, and everything that did and
      didn't happen at the same time.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (So yeah, their ignorance of linear time has got to be pretty heavy.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (... so what does that make us? If we have a noticeable "weight?")
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I mean, we're not from here. We came from outside of creation, so...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess we have more influence over this world than we know.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (But we can't just do whatever, it hurts when we get hit by swords and
      stuff, so how would we influence the world?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179654
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh, I guess through CHIM and stuff, which is it's own bag of worms,
      one more complicated than it's probably worth.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179655
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179656
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah... anyway can you hand over the cube and sphere now? We don't
      have all day.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, but your weight must be studied! For all I know the two of you are
      Shezarrine-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I mean, as the Last Dragonborn, I probably am...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, our machinations are beyond your comprehension, buddy. Your role
      is to give as the sphere and cube, so just do it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10a45569f6aa8cb4887efd705668c14d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, my apologies! Far be it from mere Septimus to get in the way of Prisoners-Who-Know.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179661
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Septimus gives me the attument sphere and the lexicon cube.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright Monika, let's get the hell out of here before he goes on another
      rant about obscure Kirkbridian metaphysics.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268260154179657
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
